<title>USA: COR Therapeutics says drug review date set.</title>
<headline>COR Therapeutics says drug review date set.</headline>
<dateline>SOUTH SAN FRANCISCO, Calif. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>COR Therapeutics Inc on Wednesday said the U.S. Food and Drug Administration has scheduled an advisory committee meeting on February 27 and 28 to review the company's drug, Integrilin.</p>
<p>The review will be conducted by the FDA's Cardiovascular and Renal Drugs Advisory Committee, COR said in a statement.</p>
<p>Shares of COR were up 1-5/8 to 11-13/16 by midday.</p>
<p>Integrilin is used to help prevent acute cardiac ischemic complications in patients undergoing percutaneous transluminal coronary angioplasty (PTCA).</p>
